T-GPS baseline
--------------
recovery_tools/workshop_functional_attack.py identifies its bounded local
baseline as an adaptation of the T-GPS procedure:
https://github.com/TrustAIRLab/T-GPS

The experiment's recorded upstream reference is commit:
0346ef2fab836d43a28691a0eb58cdc304d450ee

The local implementation generates a draft, obtains discrepancy feedback,
produces five revisions, and selects among six candidates using local
execution. It uses local Qwen and Llama models and token-F1 selection under
the declared query budget. This is a bounded local adaptation, not the
upstream API configuration. The upstream repository and its files are not
vendored in this export.
